85	     * formatted {@code 'FY<YY>'} where YY is the last two digits of the fiscal year (see
86	     * {@link #fiscalYear(LocalDate)}), e.g. {@code 'FY27'}. Returns {@code null} when no registration
87	     * date is present (the field is then absent from the DTO).
88	     */
89	    default String toFiscalYear(Owner owner) {
